{
    "title": "Save the Doggy: Draw to Rescue",
    "description": "OMG! The bees are dangerous, and they coming now ....\r\n\r\nSave The Doggy is a super casual puzzle game which need you draw line to protect the dog from attacks by bees in the hive. You need to use your brain to save the doge.\r\n\r\n<b>How to play</b>\r\n1. Draw anywhere with a line to protect the dog\r\n2. Try to draw a short line for more scores\r\n3. Wait for the bees to attack\r\n4. Hold your wall for 10 seconds, so that the dog will not be attacked by bees\r\n\r\nBelieve it or not, playing this puzzle game would make you smart, but how many levels can you clear? Prove yourself by drawing a line and save the dog now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "OMG! The bees are dangerous, and they coming now ....<br><br>Save The Doggy is a super casual puzzle game which need you draw line to protect the dog from attacks by bees in the hive. You need to use your brain to save the doge.<br><br><b>How to play</b><br>1. Draw anywhere with a line to protect the dog<br>2. Try to draw a short line for more scores<br>3. Wait for the bees to attack<br>4. Hold your wall for 10 seconds, so that the dog will not be attacked by bees<br><br>Believe it or not, playing this puzzle game would make you smart, but how many levels can you clear? Prove yourself by drawing a line and save the dog now!",
